WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.525
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.795 --> 00:15.995
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:16.065 --> 00:19.095
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:19.165 --> 00:22.365
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:23.435 --> 00:25.335
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.685 --> 00:40.085
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.155 --> 00:41.585
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.655 --> 00:43.095
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
00:47.065 --> 00:49.565
It really was my father.

10
00:56.335 --> 00:59.405
Han Jung Woo, no, Um Tae Bong.

11
00:59.475 --> 01:03.315
Please, find my father.

12
01:05.445 --> 01:06.445
Let's go for now.

13
01:09.985 --> 01:11.615
(Episode 4)

14
01:12.615 --> 01:16.295
It was right here. He definitely went this way earlier.

15
01:16.355 --> 01:17.925
Does that make sense?

16
01:17.995 --> 01:20.065
You must have seen it wrong.

17
01:20.125 --> 01:22.065
No, it was definitely my father.

18
01:42.715 --> 01:43.785
I'm sorry.

19
01:57.535 --> 01:58.595
The person you saw earlier...

20
02:00.205 --> 02:02.135
What was he wearing? Tell me in detail.

21
02:06.075 --> 02:08.145
Don't look at me like that. You said you really saw him.

22
02:08.205 --> 02:09.445
If it really was your father,

23
02:12.675 --> 02:13.885
there must be a reason.

24
03:00.095 --> 03:01.225
Excuse me.

25
03:01.925 --> 03:02.935
I'm sorry.

26
03:10.775 --> 03:11.775
Sir?

27
03:22.085 --> 03:23.085
Did you find him?

28
03:28.355 --> 03:30.455
See? You were mistaken.

29
03:31.525 --> 03:33.895
- Your father is not here. - Hey, it's Um Tae Bong.

30
03:33.965 --> 03:36.225
Oh, it really is Um Tae Bong. Who is the woman next to him?

31
03:36.225 --> 03:37.835
- Take it off. - Is she his girlfriend?

32
03:37.835 --> 03:39.705
Take it off before your face gets exposed.

33
03:40.305 --> 03:42.935
- I think it is him. - It is Um Tae Bong.

34
03:43.005 --> 03:44.835
It's Um Tae Bong. Right?

35
03:44.905 --> 03:46.445
- It is. - You're right.

36
03:48.805 --> 03:49.815
An exclusive...

37
03:50.875 --> 03:53.915
Where did you learn such terrible manners,

38
03:54.215 --> 03:56.015
touching others and filming without permission?

39
03:58.685 --> 04:01.085
Was the line I said during yesterday's shoot,

40
04:01.155 --> 04:03.455
but it would be best if a line just remains a line, right?

41
04:03.525 --> 04:04.695
Oh, yes.

42
04:07.325 --> 04:08.325
Let's go.

43
04:11.365 --> 04:14.035
(Janchi Noodles, Bibim Noodles)

44
04:16.805 --> 04:17.975
You can go by yourself, right?

45
04:18.035 --> 04:19.035
Yes.

46
04:20.745 --> 04:21.775
Oh, hey.

47
04:23.545 --> 04:24.845
That line from earlier...

48
04:26.245 --> 04:27.745
was pretty cool.

49
04:30.055 --> 04:31.055
It wasn't a line.

50
04:33.885 --> 04:35.785
This woman is overestimating me.

51
04:35.855 --> 04:38.095
Do I look like someone who would remember a line after the shoot?

52
04:40.595 --> 04:41.595
Get going.

53
04:42.865 --> 04:45.535
Thank you, Um Tae Bong.

54
04:52.535 --> 04:53.545
What?

55
04:55.775 --> 04:57.775
I think you just said something.

56
05:03.215 --> 05:05.355
Don't get distracted and go straight home.

57
05:59.745 --> 06:00.745
What?

58
06:04.245 --> 06:05.245
Hong Du.

59
06:05.745 --> 06:07.785
Is something wrong?

60
06:09.015 --> 06:10.815
Oh, this.

61
06:14.025 --> 06:17.195
My father is a bit shy,

62
06:17.595 --> 06:19.225
so we will have to postpone tonight's dinner invitation.

63
06:22.065 --> 06:23.495
Then next time,

64
06:23.965 --> 06:25.795
we will have something even more delicious than today's menu.

65
06:26.235 --> 06:27.235
Okay.

66
06:48.885 --> 06:50.155
Hey.

67
06:51.825 --> 06:52.825
I'm sorry.

68
06:55.465 --> 06:56.935
I did that too.

69
06:56.995 --> 07:00.605
Um Tae Bong, please find my father.

70
07:01.635 --> 07:04.675
Even so, how can she be so sincere about a misunderstanding?

71
07:05.005 --> 07:06.575
As if she really saw her father.

72
07:06.845 --> 07:08.145
I told you, right?

73
07:08.405 --> 07:10.675
Never go around alone.

74
07:11.075 --> 07:13.315
She has been like that since we first met.

75
07:14.215 --> 07:17.555
Like someone who actually knew me from before.

76
07:21.325 --> 07:22.425
My head hurts.

77
07:22.755 --> 07:24.255
It really hurts because of Cha Hong Du.

78
07:35.365 --> 07:37.705
Ruining the meal is all because of you, Father.

79
07:38.405 --> 07:41.545
Complaining about no side dishes, or dirt on the food...

80
07:43.275 --> 07:44.445
Just try yelling at me.

81
07:48.445 --> 07:50.855
If you do, I will ignore you even if you show up in my dreams.

82
07:55.725 --> 07:56.825
I mean it.

83
08:06.465 --> 08:07.465
No.

84
08:09.005 --> 08:10.035
I'm kidding.

85
08:12.275 --> 08:13.575
That was a lie.

86
08:17.475 --> 08:19.175
I won't ignore you.

87
08:22.915 --> 08:24.055
So...

88
08:26.725 --> 08:27.825
You have to come visit me...

89
08:29.385 --> 08:31.395
in my dreams, Dad.

90
08:35.065 --> 08:38.835
Then I won't just follow someone because they look like you.

91
08:40.565 --> 08:43.205
You are really gone now, right, Dad?

92
09:03.155 --> 09:05.895
He absolutely cannot sing.

93
09:05.955 --> 09:07.095
- Singing? - Yes.

94
09:07.095 --> 09:08.195
(Hyun Ji's Happy Night)

95
09:08.195 --> 09:10.195
You get a free pass since you are Tae Bong's staff.

96
09:10.595 --> 09:12.595
Make sure to bring your ID next time.

97
09:12.665 --> 09:15.035
Yes, I understand.

98
09:15.105 --> 09:16.775
But you look a little different from yesterday.

99
09:17.175 --> 09:20.575
Your face looks puffy. Did you get Botox?

100
09:20.775 --> 09:22.675
- Excuse me? - Can't you tell?

101
09:22.675 --> 09:24.875
Does that bouncy ball face look like Botox to you?

102
09:25.145 --> 09:26.215
Please...

103
09:28.945 --> 09:31.985
She is swollen from crying yesterday.

104
09:34.325 --> 09:36.555
Yes, the king of ratings, the master of romance,

105
09:36.625 --> 09:39.995
the ultimate heartthrob, Um Tae Bong, is here with us.

106
09:40.065 --> 09:42.595
You are currently in a very public relationship.

107
09:42.665 --> 09:45.465
Is it with the person we all know?

108
09:49.235 --> 09:52.475
I'm really curious about what made you fall for her.

109
09:52.535 --> 09:53.775
They are lasting longer than I thought.

110
09:54.505 --> 09:56.345
I thought he didn't really like...

111
09:56.405 --> 09:58.675
- Song Na Ri's type. - Spill it. Tell us.

112
09:58.745 --> 10:01.015
Well, she...

113
10:01.885 --> 10:02.985
has pale skin...

114
10:04.315 --> 10:05.655
and long fingers?

115
10:06.455 --> 10:11.055
I thought a ring would look really good on those fingers.

116
10:12.255 --> 10:16.965
Oh my, does that mean you already have a ring ready for her?

117
10:18.695 --> 10:19.735
Maybe.

118
10:20.405 --> 10:23.935
Now, whether that lucky lady is the Na Ri we all know,

119
10:24.005 --> 10:27.875
or someone else entirely, well, we don't know yet.

120
10:27.945 --> 10:32.045
To all our female listeners out there, keep your hopes up.

121
10:32.175 --> 10:35.385
We will be right back after a song. Here is CNBLUE with "I Am a Loner."

122
10:37.655 --> 10:40.525
He does. He has had one since before he was famous.

123
10:40.585 --> 10:44.195
The One Ring, filled with all his years of sorrow.

124
10:45.055 --> 10:46.425
I guess he is going to propose with it later.

125
10:48.025 --> 10:49.025
Oh...

126
10:51.395 --> 10:53.705
I was wearing it without even knowing that.

127
11:04.315 --> 11:06.075
That is really bothering me.

128
11:08.185 --> 11:09.985
Oh, I'm sorry.

129
11:10.055 --> 11:12.215
How long is she going to stand there like that?

130
11:12.285 --> 11:13.955
It will be over soon.

131
11:21.865 --> 11:23.865
Are you not going to ask me to sing?

132
11:24.865 --> 11:25.865
Excuse me?

133
11:27.135 --> 11:28.365
Hey, the mic is still on.

134
11:29.365 --> 11:30.405
What is going on?

135
11:30.475 --> 11:31.835
(Making Him Sing Leads To Disaster)

136
11:32.875 --> 11:36.645
I smile a little so the tears will not fall

137
11:36.705 --> 11:40.285
Why are you doing this to me? What are you saying?

138
11:40.345 --> 11:44.185
All the words you said today up into the sky

139
11:44.255 --> 11:48.025
- The words I could never say - What's wrong with this?

140
11:48.085 --> 11:51.955
The words I never knew I would say while crying

141
11:52.025 --> 11:58.895
I like you so much

142
11:59.465 --> 12:00.935
What should I do?

143
12:02.965 --> 12:04.305
You idiot.

144
12:05.305 --> 12:09.445
Of all the songs, why did you pick the one with the three high notes?

145
12:09.505 --> 12:10.575
Um Tae Bong is completely tone-deaf.

146
12:10.645 --> 12:11.645
I thought it was a live mistake.

147
12:11.715 --> 12:12.715
I just spit out my food.

148
12:12.775 --> 12:15.715
The words I might never be able to say again

149
12:15.785 --> 12:22.385
I like you so much

150
12:22.455 --> 12:24.725
Goodness! One, two

151
12:24.795 --> 12:29.295
I'm in my dream

152
12:34.005 --> 12:35.405
Is it funny?

153
12:35.465 --> 12:36.735
I think so, maybe.

154
12:37.335 --> 12:38.635
Then it worked.

155
12:39.105 --> 12:40.245
Stop crying now.

156
12:40.745 --> 12:42.605
Even if something really worth crying about happens.

157
12:42.675 --> 12:44.615
Even if something really worth crying about happens?

158
12:45.375 --> 12:47.445
You are already not much to look at,

159
12:47.515 --> 12:50.555
and you look even worse when you cry.

160
12:53.215 --> 12:54.725
Seriously, why did you do that earlier?

161
12:54.785 --> 12:56.995
Knowing it would cause a catastrophe like this.

162
12:58.625 --> 12:59.625
Tell me about it.

163
13:01.195 --> 13:02.225
(CEO Park)

164
13:07.805 --> 13:08.935
(CEO Park)

165
13:09.935 --> 13:12.605
Sir. We really tried our hardest to stop him.

166
13:12.675 --> 13:13.675
It is like he was possessed...

167
13:13.745 --> 13:15.675
No, it is fine. He did well.

168
13:15.745 --> 13:17.945
The internet is going absolutely crazy right now.

169
13:18.975 --> 13:20.445
Hey. Calls are coming in.

170
13:22.285 --> 13:24.715
"He is so bad at singing, it makes him more relatable."

171
13:24.915 --> 13:26.925
"I had given up on him, but today I'm a fan again."

172
13:26.985 --> 13:28.325
"My mom, who was suffering from depression,"

173
13:28.385 --> 13:30.695
"completely got over it thanks to Um Tae Bong's singing."

174
13:30.755 --> 13:32.125
Oh, the mood totally flipped.

175
13:32.195 --> 13:35.125
Tae Bong, but singing is really the one thing you cannot do.

176
13:35.195 --> 13:37.295
You would never sing even if your life depended on it.

177
13:37.365 --> 13:38.935
You have been acting really strange lately.

178
13:38.995 --> 13:40.505
I think so too.

179
13:45.605 --> 13:47.275
So, are you going to cure my motion sickness too?

180
13:54.745 --> 13:55.745
Darn it.

181
13:58.115 --> 13:59.415
That recording of my singing from earlier...

182
13:59.755 --> 14:01.625
People online said...

183
14:01.685 --> 14:04.255
that making it feel like you are not even in a car...

184
14:04.255 --> 14:05.925
is the best cure for motion sickness.

185
14:06.125 --> 14:07.465
How is it? Working like a charm, right?

186
14:07.595 --> 14:10.235
Welcome to the Um Tae Bong concert.

187
14:10.295 --> 14:12.765
You are killing me with this noise. A charm, my foot.

188
14:12.835 --> 14:14.435
You need a smack upside the head...

189
14:14.765 --> 14:15.805
Hey...

190
14:18.575 --> 14:19.575
Darn it...

191
14:30.455 --> 14:31.955
I think her motion sickness actually got better.

192
14:33.085 --> 14:36.225
Keep that with you at all times. If you lose it, you are dead.

193
14:40.595 --> 14:41.695
(CEO Park)

194
14:44.095 --> 14:46.665
What now? I thought the mood turned around.

195
14:49.235 --> 14:50.405
What is going on?

196
14:50.405 --> 14:51.875
Anyway, getting off early is nice.

197
14:54.605 --> 14:56.945
What? Is the sky telling you something?

198
14:57.475 --> 14:58.545
Is it going to rain later?

199
14:59.775 --> 15:01.015
It's strange,

200
15:02.115 --> 15:03.545
but everything just feels so good.

201
15:04.355 --> 15:05.655
The sky,

202
15:07.525 --> 15:08.755
the air,

203
15:10.155 --> 15:11.555
the people,

204
15:12.095 --> 15:13.095
all of it.

205
15:14.895 --> 15:16.865
- I'm going to be late. - Where are you going?

206
15:17.465 --> 15:19.895
The Haneul Columbarium. Yesterday was my father's memorial.

207
15:21.105 --> 15:23.435
For there, you see that bus stop over there?

208
15:23.675 --> 15:25.275
Take the 745 from there. It goes straight.

209
15:26.435 --> 15:27.805
How do you know all that?

210
15:28.175 --> 15:30.275
I go there a lot. Columbarium scenes in dramas...

211
15:30.345 --> 15:31.575
are almost always filmed there.

212
15:33.685 --> 15:35.415
- Go on, then. - All right.

213
15:35.485 --> 15:36.515
Get home safe.

214
15:44.225 --> 15:46.955
I have the motion sickness cure Tae Bong gave me.

215
15:51.635 --> 15:54.205
Oh my, what in the world happened?

216
15:56.965 --> 15:59.035
To think the nation's father figure ended up like this.

217
15:59.105 --> 16:01.345
The patient probably will not remember you, Mr. Um.

218
16:01.745 --> 16:04.545
To be exact, he does not even remember...

219
16:04.615 --> 16:06.315
what kind of person he used to be.

220
16:11.355 --> 16:12.715
Sir.

221
16:13.725 --> 16:15.325
Do I smell?

222
16:16.525 --> 16:17.995
My daughter told me...

223
16:18.925 --> 16:20.425
that I smell like an old widower.

224
16:21.465 --> 16:24.135
I should change before she scolds me.

225
16:24.665 --> 16:25.865
Have you seen my daughter?

226
16:26.135 --> 16:29.335
She is a huge fan of spicy rice cakes.

227
16:32.175 --> 16:33.405
Wait, no.

228
16:34.005 --> 16:36.475
My daughter hates spicy rice cakes.

229
16:42.185 --> 16:44.355
Some patients forget reality...

230
16:44.755 --> 16:47.155
and wish to live in a world of their own making.

231
16:47.625 --> 16:50.255
It is time for my daughter to come home.

232
16:51.825 --> 16:52.955
I need to go home.

233
16:53.025 --> 16:54.795
Mr. Choi is exactly that kind of case.

234
16:55.265 --> 16:57.965
He wants to live in a fictional world created by his dementia.

235
16:58.235 --> 17:01.565
That world is a mixture of dramas and reality.

236
17:01.635 --> 17:02.635
Sir.

237
17:04.705 --> 17:08.575
It was freezing for a few days, but it is bearable today.

238
17:11.175 --> 17:12.975
From now on,

239
17:13.045 --> 17:15.885
- I will not be late. - It is okay to be late sometimes.

240
17:16.745 --> 17:18.085
It is fine.

241
17:18.515 --> 17:20.455
Was his name Min Seok?

242
17:21.155 --> 17:24.295
I don't see the friend you used to hang around with.

243
17:28.865 --> 17:30.995
Have you heard the saying about the weight of the crown?

244
17:31.995 --> 17:35.065
Giving someone a proper send-off...

245
17:35.135 --> 17:36.965
is a way of enduring...

246
17:37.035 --> 17:38.405
that weight.

247
17:41.305 --> 17:42.945
All right, see you later.

248
17:44.945 --> 17:45.945
Sir.

249
17:48.115 --> 17:49.485
That...

250
17:49.545 --> 17:50.555
This.

251
17:53.715 --> 17:54.825
This morning,

252
17:57.025 --> 17:59.225
I sent my wife off.

253
18:00.995 --> 18:03.165
For the sake of those left behind,

254
18:03.225 --> 18:05.035
she left on a day that was not too cold.

255
18:07.335 --> 18:08.405
I'm grateful.

256
18:10.775 --> 18:12.905
She is someone to be grateful for.

257
18:30.795 --> 18:32.855
That is when you finally came to your senses.

258
18:34.595 --> 18:37.735
After you sent Min Seok off, you were living in a daze,

259
18:38.365 --> 18:40.905
but you said you snapped out of it after meeting Mr. Choi.

260
18:43.005 --> 18:44.035
I did.

261
18:45.105 --> 18:48.405
He lost his daughter in an accident not too long ago,

262
18:48.475 --> 18:50.615
and it seems his condition worsened suddenly.

263
18:50.675 --> 18:51.675
The doctor said...

264
18:51.745 --> 18:54.815
he keeps trying to go back to the time...

265
18:54.815 --> 18:56.715
when he lived with his wife and daughter.

266
18:56.785 --> 18:59.855
That must be the time he wants to remember the most.

267
18:59.915 --> 19:01.825
Even yesterday, he was wandering around...

268
19:01.825 --> 19:03.085
in front of his daughter's old school,

269
19:03.155 --> 19:04.795
and it seems our staff brought him back.

270
19:12.895 --> 19:15.205
I think I saw him there yesterday.

271
19:15.765 --> 19:16.765
What?

272
19:17.835 --> 19:19.605
I was distracted by something else,

273
19:20.275 --> 19:22.905
- so I thought I was seeing things. - You went there? Why?

274
19:25.375 --> 19:26.875
Please take good care of him from now on.

275
19:26.945 --> 19:28.815
Deduct all his hospital bills from my account.

276
19:28.885 --> 19:29.945
Yes, I got it.

277
19:31.585 --> 19:34.985
He must have become very frail. That is how humans are...

278
19:35.585 --> 19:36.655
when you are lonely.

279
19:37.895 --> 19:39.495
Oh, it hurts.

280
20:20.495 --> 20:22.835
This stop is Geumsan...

281
20:31.875 --> 20:33.675
She said they shot a lot of dramas here,

282
20:33.745 --> 20:34.985
and I guess it was true.

283
21:08.685 --> 21:10.215
This is still here.

284
21:14.525 --> 21:16.485
You are saying there is no one named Cha Gil Dong?

285
21:16.555 --> 21:17.695
(Funeral Facility Usage Inquiry)

286
21:17.755 --> 21:19.125
(Inquiry Result: No Data Found)

287
21:19.325 --> 21:20.795
I looked everywhere, but there is no record.

288
21:21.965 --> 21:24.765
- Are you sure this is the place? - This is the place.

289
21:26.595 --> 21:28.565
I built that stone tower over there.

290
21:28.905 --> 21:32.175
I did mistake someone who looked like him for my father once,

291
21:32.235 --> 21:33.605
but I remember this place for sure.

292
21:33.675 --> 21:35.575
- This is the place. - Someone who looked like him?

293
21:36.505 --> 21:38.515
Could it be that?

294
21:38.715 --> 21:40.685
You know, the same thing happened last month.

295
21:40.745 --> 21:42.515
The head of the household,

296
21:42.585 --> 21:44.215
to leave the death benefit for his family,

297
21:44.285 --> 21:47.285
- faked his own death. - Oh, the one...

298
21:47.355 --> 21:49.685
who lived as a homeless man for ten years pretending to be dead?

299
21:49.955 --> 21:52.595
- I saw that on the news too. - Pretending to be dead?

300
22:35.535 --> 22:39.135
Could the young lady be somewhere, eating a warm meal?

301
22:42.075 --> 22:43.105
She is not a child.

302
22:44.275 --> 22:45.515
The security footage that caught Hae Ra,

303
22:45.575 --> 22:46.745
did you collect all of it?

304
22:47.145 --> 22:49.815
Make sure the press or the police don't get involved,

305
22:50.545 --> 22:52.655
and keep the workers quiet.

306
22:56.785 --> 22:57.925
Why are you not answering?

307
23:04.535 --> 23:05.895
I was just thinking.

308
23:07.395 --> 23:11.235
Perhaps you don't want her to return.

309
23:12.535 --> 23:15.945
If the reason is the same as that day 20 years ago,

310
23:19.145 --> 23:21.315
I will not make the same mistake.

311
23:27.825 --> 23:30.685
You are talking too much today. Go in and rest.

312
23:32.425 --> 23:33.925
Maybe she...

313
23:34.395 --> 23:36.065
does not want to come back.

314
23:43.465 --> 23:44.975
What does that mean?

315
23:44.975 --> 23:46.335
Tell me so I can understand...

316
23:51.145 --> 23:52.545
Did you find her?

317
23:52.615 --> 23:55.215
If I had, I would have brought her here.

318
24:15.065 --> 24:17.465
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

319
24:17.535 --> 24:20.275
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

320
24:26.745 --> 24:28.615
Look into actor Um Tae Bong thoroughly.

321
24:29.185 --> 24:31.585
They recently hired a new junior staff member.

322
24:31.655 --> 24:33.385
Her name is Cha...

323
24:38.225 --> 24:39.895
Getting carsick is so uncool.

324
24:46.395 --> 24:48.535
Why do I get like this whenever I get in a car?

325
24:50.265 --> 24:52.605
He is so petty, threatening to cancel on me.

326
24:52.675 --> 24:53.675
Hong Du?

327
24:55.905 --> 24:56.945
Hello.

328
24:59.875 --> 25:01.315
What about your family?

329
25:01.385 --> 25:02.715
If you're alone now,

330
25:02.785 --> 25:04.885
is there anyone to keep you company...

331
25:05.015 --> 25:08.285
Are you not busy? I'm incredibly busy.

332
25:08.525 --> 25:10.625
I have to hurry up and set the table for my dad.

333
25:10.685 --> 25:12.525
Call me when you have a schedule.

334
25:22.035 --> 25:23.205
Awesome.

335
25:45.855 --> 25:49.695
I'm sorry, Chairman. I saw something you did not.

336
25:51.095 --> 25:52.835
The young lady...

337
25:52.895 --> 25:53.935
smiled.

338
26:06.815 --> 26:07.915
Maybe...

339
26:09.715 --> 26:10.815
my father...

340
26:15.755 --> 26:17.325
is still alive too?

341
26:29.705 --> 26:31.675
The ride quality of the new car...

342
26:31.735 --> 26:33.375
Oh, I see.

343
26:33.435 --> 26:37.675
Then please tell Um Tae Bong that I'm a huge fan,

344
26:37.675 --> 26:39.315
and we should grab a meal sometime...

345
26:39.375 --> 26:40.375
Hello...

346
26:41.615 --> 26:42.945
What a jerk.

347
26:43.015 --> 26:45.015
He is just Um Tae Bong's manager, not Um Tae Bong himself.

348
26:45.085 --> 26:46.585
Oh, seriously, man.

349
26:46.655 --> 26:48.155
Oh, why? Did he say it wasn't good?

350
26:50.555 --> 26:53.495
No. He said it was amazing.

351
26:54.565 --> 26:55.925
Hey, do you know how much that car costs?

352
26:55.995 --> 26:57.665
Of course it is amazing.

353
26:59.295 --> 27:02.805
- Why did the director do that? - That is what I'm saying.

354
27:02.865 --> 27:05.105
Who does he think he is, giving away our new car as a gift?

355
27:05.175 --> 27:07.475
That director, with his pretty face,

356
27:07.535 --> 27:09.305
looks like he has never struggled a day in his life.

357
27:09.375 --> 27:11.145
Those who were just born with a silver spoon in their mouths...

358
27:11.215 --> 27:13.145
and return after studying abroad...

359
27:13.145 --> 27:15.215
If we fought without our titles,

360
27:15.285 --> 27:16.945
it would be game over for them. Right?

361
27:17.015 --> 27:18.255
I would just...

362
27:23.525 --> 27:24.955
You must be talking about something interesting.

363
27:25.755 --> 27:27.725
We were just discussing the gaming industry...

364
27:28.725 --> 27:30.965
Manager Na, I looked through the materials you gave me this morning,

365
27:31.035 --> 27:32.595
and the domestic trend analysis was missing.

366
27:32.665 --> 27:34.805
Oh, that's in the reference room. I will quickly go and...

367
27:35.405 --> 27:36.405
I will go.

368
27:40.035 --> 27:41.505
- Oh, by the way, - Yes, sir.

369
27:41.575 --> 27:42.805
I was not born with a silver spoon.

370
27:56.525 --> 27:58.025
(Ilsin Daily, Hangil News, Jeonggyeong Daily, Hankook Ilbo)

371
28:02.095 --> 28:04.125
(Will Wang Hui Yeon's Accident Remain A Mystery?)

372
28:08.265 --> 28:09.605
(Ilsin Daily)

373
28:09.665 --> 28:12.505
(Will Wang Hui Yeon's Accident Remain A Mystery?)

374
28:19.415 --> 28:21.015
(Hanil News)

375
28:23.045 --> 28:27.215
But that heiress is too shrouded in mystery.

376
28:27.285 --> 28:28.685
No one has even seen her...

377
28:29.125 --> 28:30.285
That is understandable.

378
28:30.355 --> 28:32.295
A young child went through something like that.

379
28:36.665 --> 28:39.035
What could have happened to make her hide...

380
28:41.505 --> 28:42.835
from the world like that?

381
28:45.605 --> 28:48.345
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

382
29:01.285 --> 29:03.125
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

383
29:14.235 --> 29:15.865
With just a name and age,

384
29:15.935 --> 29:17.975
how am I supposed to check a death certificate?

385
29:18.035 --> 29:19.735
Do you think there is only one Cha Gil Dong in the country?

386
29:19.805 --> 29:21.245
Then what about Na Ae Jeong?

387
29:21.305 --> 29:22.945
I really have something to ask my stepmother.

388
29:23.005 --> 29:24.405
Do you not know about the Personal Information Protection Act?

389
29:24.815 --> 29:26.675
If a voice phishing incident happens...

390
29:27.645 --> 29:31.255
Oh, then, could you ask her to contact me...

391
29:36.225 --> 29:38.025
Yes, yes, I understand. I will pass it on.

392
29:38.095 --> 29:39.195
Please do.

393
29:41.765 --> 29:43.625
(Cha Hong Du)

394
29:48.465 --> 29:49.465
Cha Hong Du...

395
29:54.235 --> 29:55.675
- Hae Ra... - I heard...

396
29:55.675 --> 29:58.345
the Personal Information Protection Act is very important.

397
29:58.875 --> 30:00.345
What are you going to do with someone else's number?

398
30:00.415 --> 30:01.415
Are you...

399
30:03.045 --> 30:04.385
voice phishing?

400
30:05.255 --> 30:06.715
- Excuse me. - What? What is it?

401
30:06.785 --> 30:09.285
No, it's just that this man here...

402
30:09.355 --> 30:11.825
What the? Darn it.

403
30:16.195 --> 30:18.765
- Hello? - Cha Hong Du, why are you not here?

404
30:19.765 --> 30:21.605
Darn it, I'm late.

405
30:21.835 --> 30:24.335
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

406
30:32.515 --> 30:34.075
She really did not recognize me.

407
30:36.545 --> 30:39.315
But Cha Hong Du...

408
30:40.815 --> 30:42.185
Cha Hong Du...

409
30:43.725 --> 30:45.695
It sounds familiar for some reason...

410
30:52.665 --> 30:54.295
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

411
31:02.545 --> 31:03.875
The Crown...

412
31:04.745 --> 31:05.815
Prince's...

413
31:11.485 --> 31:13.415
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

414
31:13.485 --> 31:15.055
(Characters)

415
31:15.225 --> 31:16.685
Cha Hong Du.

416
31:19.325 --> 31:20.355
Could it be...

417
31:22.865 --> 31:24.125
Did you hear the rumor?

418
31:24.195 --> 31:26.095
Some celebrity got attacked by a crazy guy...

419
31:26.165 --> 31:27.395
in the underground parking lot.

420
31:27.465 --> 31:29.705
Really? I didn't hear the news.

421
31:29.765 --> 31:30.805
Who was it?

422
31:30.805 --> 31:32.575
- They are talking about you. - Rumor says it is an actor,

423
31:32.575 --> 31:34.205
but they keep quiet. It's bad news.

424
31:34.275 --> 31:37.005
Is it an anti-fan? What if they come to our set?

425
31:43.485 --> 31:44.815
By the way, Ms. Hong Du, why are you here?

426
31:44.885 --> 31:46.155
The stylists are all resting over there.

427
31:46.215 --> 31:47.215
No!

428
31:50.925 --> 31:52.155
I mean...

429
31:52.225 --> 31:53.255
My clothes...

430
31:53.325 --> 31:55.295
are sensitive to humidity, temperature change, and water drops.

431
31:55.365 --> 31:56.795
They crease easily.

432
31:56.865 --> 31:59.395
If you are a stylist, you should not take your eyes off my clothes.

433
31:59.465 --> 32:02.065
Look at this. It is creased. It is creased!

434
32:02.135 --> 32:03.965
That is because you just spit on it.

435
32:04.775 --> 32:05.835
I'm comfortable here too.

436
32:07.135 --> 32:09.405
- Ms. Hong Du is an angel. - By the way,

437
32:09.475 --> 32:11.005
was there not a similar incident before?

438
32:11.075 --> 32:14.045
Some woman couldn't tell drama from reality,

439
32:14.115 --> 32:15.615
so she went to find her favorite celebrity...

440
32:15.685 --> 32:16.885
and made a scene, claiming they were married...

441
32:16.885 --> 32:18.755
and that she was having his baby.

442
32:18.815 --> 32:22.055
People with harsh realities and hard lives do that.

443
32:22.125 --> 32:23.225
They must be desperate to do that.

444
32:23.285 --> 32:25.625
They just want to forget reality, even if it means doing that.

445
32:25.695 --> 32:27.695
I feel really bad for people like that.

446
32:35.605 --> 32:37.835
What? The data we shot yesterday is corrupted?

447
32:38.105 --> 32:40.605
What kind of nonsense is that? Darn it.

448
32:40.675 --> 32:41.975
Give me that.

449
32:42.675 --> 32:45.915
Hey, Star Um. It is just four lines of dialogue,

450
32:45.975 --> 32:48.015
and the location connects to here today,

451
32:48.585 --> 32:49.585
so doing it once more is fine, right?

452
32:49.645 --> 32:51.085
No, why would I?

453
32:51.355 --> 32:52.385
You know perfectly well that...

454
32:52.455 --> 32:54.655
I wipe my memory clean as soon as the shoot is over.

455
32:55.255 --> 32:58.495
I can't do it! "South Korean detectives..."

456
32:58.555 --> 33:01.425
"Taekwondo, judo, hapkido, boxing..."

457
33:02.625 --> 33:04.295
Taekwondo, judo...

458
33:04.365 --> 33:06.895
Hey, darn it. It is long, it is too long.

459
33:06.965 --> 33:10.065
Hold on. "Taekwondo, judo, hapkido, boxing."

460
33:10.135 --> 33:12.975
- Tae, ju, hap, box. - He is really weird.

461
33:13.775 --> 33:15.775
I mean, how does that guy's mind go completely blank...

462
33:15.845 --> 33:18.445
as soon as the shoot is over? Unbelievable.

463
33:20.645 --> 33:21.645
Hey, you.

464
33:25.515 --> 33:26.615
Look at me.

465
33:27.085 --> 33:28.955
Yes. You over there.

466
33:48.675 --> 33:49.675
How old are you?

467
33:51.715 --> 33:55.085
- And how old are you? - What? What did you say?

468
33:55.145 --> 33:56.645
Are you talking to me right now?

469
33:56.715 --> 33:58.045
Oh, did you not hear me?

470
33:58.115 --> 34:00.355
Your eyes were darting around so much,

471
34:00.415 --> 34:02.685
- I thought you heard everything. - My eyes are what?

472
34:02.755 --> 34:03.755
I'm naturally good at shaking things.

473
34:03.825 --> 34:05.955
I shake my waist, I shake my hips, and I shake my eyes.

474
34:06.025 --> 34:08.165
You must not have known,

475
34:08.225 --> 34:09.525
but I'm in a girl group.

476
34:10.725 --> 34:11.965
Now that you mention it,

477
34:12.035 --> 34:13.495
it seems like your brain is shaking, too.

478
34:13.995 --> 34:15.435
My brain?

479
34:15.505 --> 34:16.505
Whatever.

480
34:17.635 --> 34:20.275
It is Tae Bong's birthday next week, so I want to get him a gift.

481
34:20.335 --> 34:22.545
Do you know what his favorite brand is?

482
34:22.605 --> 34:24.245
Um Tae Bong's birthday isn't next week.

483
34:25.345 --> 34:28.145
- Yes, it is. - That is just his official profile.

484
34:28.285 --> 34:29.985
When he was born, the umbilical cord was wrapped around his neck,

485
34:30.045 --> 34:31.245
so it was very dangerous.

486
34:31.245 --> 34:32.555
A skilled shaman told them...

487
34:32.615 --> 34:34.925
that registering his birth early would lengthen his lifespan.

488
34:34.985 --> 34:36.655
So his official birthday is one week early.

489
34:37.725 --> 34:38.895
I guess you did not know that?

490
34:40.125 --> 34:42.625
Who said I didn't know? I knew it from the start.

491
34:42.695 --> 34:44.625
I'm Tae Bong's obsessive fangirl.

492
34:44.695 --> 34:45.735
His profile birthday and his real one,

493
34:45.795 --> 34:47.195
I was going to celebrate both of them. Why?

494
34:47.265 --> 34:49.435
Do you have money to burn? Are we done here?

495
34:49.905 --> 34:50.905
Wait a minute.

496
34:52.135 --> 34:54.505
How do you know so much about him...

497
35:00.145 --> 35:01.445
Are you also...

498
35:02.485 --> 35:04.385
- Um Tae Bong fan? - Are you crazy?

499
35:08.385 --> 35:11.925
If she is not a fan, how does she know Um Tae Bong's origin story?

500
35:11.995 --> 35:15.925
My intuition tells me she is the bag girl from that photo.

501
35:17.365 --> 35:19.835
Did he hatch from an egg? What do you mean, origin story...

502
35:21.965 --> 35:24.405
Wait. How do I know this?

503
35:30.175 --> 35:32.145
Um Tae Bong must like that kind of style.

504
35:34.645 --> 35:36.615
Looks like we'll finish early. Want to grab a drink later?

505
35:36.685 --> 35:40.685
I can't. My kids are waiting for me at home.

506
35:40.755 --> 35:43.755
Then maybe I should take my wife out to eat for a change.

507
35:44.155 --> 35:45.255
Hey, Dad.

508
35:45.625 --> 35:47.695
Yes, I think I'll finish early today.

509
35:47.755 --> 35:49.325
Want to get chicken and beer with your daughter?

510
35:54.365 --> 35:55.665
Cha Hong Du,

511
35:55.935 --> 35:56.935
let's eat.

512
36:03.205 --> 36:04.205
Let's eat.

513
36:09.085 --> 36:10.685
Have you never been asked to eat before?

514
36:14.955 --> 36:16.155
I'm suddenly craving tripe.

515
36:16.425 --> 36:18.555
When you are done, go pack some up for me.

516
36:22.365 --> 36:23.825
Did your brain suddenly get fat?

517
36:24.295 --> 36:26.195
Was I hired to fetch you tripe?

518
36:26.795 --> 36:28.765
I'll pull your brain right out...

519
36:28.835 --> 36:31.675
and stuff it into some tripe.

520
36:32.505 --> 36:33.605
Seriously.

521
36:37.575 --> 36:39.315
Why did she suddenly get so aggressive?

522
36:39.375 --> 36:40.375
Liar.

523
36:40.445 --> 36:42.515
That girl was a total obsessive fangirl of yours.

524
36:42.585 --> 36:44.215
Cha Hong Du?

525
36:44.285 --> 36:47.585
Her name is Cha Hong Du? Oh, she is so busted.

526
36:47.655 --> 36:49.725
She definitely changed her name to match.

527
36:50.655 --> 36:51.655
What are you talking about?

528
36:51.725 --> 36:54.025
I mean, pulling your brain right out and stuffing it into some tripe.

529
36:54.095 --> 36:56.165
That is a line I said, too.

530
37:01.395 --> 37:03.535
And the name Cha Hong Du is the female lead...

531
37:03.605 --> 37:05.475
from "The Crown Prince's Bodyguard" that we filmed together.

532
37:12.945 --> 37:17.915
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

533
37:20.015 --> 37:21.655
(Song Na Ri As Cha Hong Du)

534
37:23.755 --> 37:26.055
No wonder that name sounded so familiar...

535
37:26.755 --> 37:28.925
No way. It must be a coincidence.

536
37:30.225 --> 37:32.765
Anyway, it is a relief she is not your bodyguard.

537
37:32.835 --> 37:34.595
If she were, it would be just like the drama,

538
37:34.665 --> 37:36.465
meaning she totally planned to get close to you.

539
37:38.135 --> 37:39.975
To call that a coincidence too...

540
37:41.645 --> 37:42.875
No way.

541
37:51.855 --> 37:52.885
You.

542
37:53.785 --> 37:54.955
Do you like me?

543
37:57.555 --> 37:59.455
Are you crazy? Why would I like you?

544
37:59.525 --> 38:00.725
Hey!

545
38:00.725 --> 38:02.525
That's gross! Get me a tissue.

546
38:03.395 --> 38:04.765
Get me a wet wipe.

547
38:07.665 --> 38:09.205
- She doesn't seem... - Ma'am, can I get a wet wipe?

548
38:09.205 --> 38:10.305
like an obsessive fangirl...

549
38:11.305 --> 38:12.375
(I Will Ruin Your Career)

550
38:12.435 --> 38:15.075
What a crazy jerk. Are you not going to report this?

551
38:15.145 --> 38:16.345
Are you not reporting this?

552
38:16.405 --> 38:20.275
We should catch him and squeeze the ink right out of his eyes...

553
38:20.345 --> 38:23.245
so he comes to his senses and never sends this kind of thing again.

554
38:23.445 --> 38:25.515
Watch your back at night, my foot.

555
38:25.585 --> 38:27.385
Should you not be protecting your artist?

556
38:27.455 --> 38:30.055
She does not seem like an anti-fan either...

557
38:38.935 --> 38:40.665
Watch out. Coming through.

558
38:50.245 --> 38:53.715
What? Why is she so unathletic?

559
38:58.045 --> 38:59.255
Then again,

560
38:59.315 --> 39:01.555
she did call herself a martial artist or whatever.

561
39:01.615 --> 39:04.185
I didn't actually see her catch that guy.

562
39:04.255 --> 39:07.255
Looking at her now, she is terrible at physical stuff.

563
39:07.795 --> 39:10.425
If she is not a die-hard fan trying to stick by my side...

564
39:10.495 --> 39:13.595
or an anti-fan trying to find my weakness and sell it,

565
39:14.595 --> 39:16.935
why did she insist on being my bodyguard?

566
39:22.105 --> 39:24.345
- What are you doing? - Gosh, you startled me.

567
39:24.405 --> 39:25.575
I almost hit you, man.

568
39:27.945 --> 39:28.945
But Tae Bong.

569
39:29.015 --> 39:32.185
You keep watching Cha Hong Du like this...

570
39:33.355 --> 39:34.455
Did you lend her money?

571
39:36.585 --> 39:37.925
- Su Dong. - Yes.

572
39:38.795 --> 39:40.195
Let's drink some coffee.

573
39:40.255 --> 39:41.255
Okay.

574
39:43.825 --> 39:45.735
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

575
39:47.865 --> 39:49.635
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

576
39:52.335 --> 39:53.675
Aren't you sick of that?

577
39:53.835 --> 39:57.505
If you are sick of it, you can change it to another song yourself.

578
39:57.575 --> 39:58.675
No,

579
39:59.475 --> 40:00.645
I like this song.

580
40:01.745 --> 40:03.915
All right, then. See you later.

581
40:07.255 --> 40:10.525
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

582
40:14.255 --> 40:15.895
He could have at least fed me dinner before sending me off.

583
40:17.965 --> 40:19.395
What should I have for a meal today?

584
40:21.165 --> 40:22.835
Gosh, I'm hungry.

585
40:33.515 --> 40:34.545
I'm finally a bit full.

586
40:36.245 --> 40:39.555
But when are you going to teach me how to drink?

587
40:41.885 --> 40:45.925
On a day when you are so lonely you really crave a drink?

588
40:46.655 --> 40:49.295
Then I will never learn how to drink.

589
40:50.395 --> 40:51.395
That's sad.

590
40:54.065 --> 40:55.435
I have never been lonely.

591
40:55.705 --> 40:58.005
Really? Not even once in your life?

592
40:59.275 --> 41:02.845
I received a lot of love from my father growing up,

593
41:02.905 --> 41:05.945
and I was super busy working part-time jobs.

594
41:06.215 --> 41:07.345
I'm jealous.

595
41:07.845 --> 41:09.015
I have been lonely a lot.

596
41:09.885 --> 41:12.315
When we immigrated to the UK, I had no friends,

597
41:12.515 --> 41:13.685
and I couldn't speak the language.

598
41:14.955 --> 41:18.625
You can stay by yourself until Mom and Dad get back from work, right?

599
41:19.025 --> 41:21.425
Make sure to turn off the lights so the neighbors don't see.

600
41:23.625 --> 41:25.665
I was afraid my parents would worry if they knew,

601
41:25.965 --> 41:27.865
so I hid those feelings completely.

602
41:28.465 --> 41:30.235
I guess you could say I grew up too fast.

603
41:30.935 --> 41:32.575
You must have missed Korea a lot.

604
41:37.105 --> 41:40.815
Is that why I care about her more?

605
41:42.445 --> 41:43.445
Her?

606
41:44.685 --> 41:45.955
A certain woman.

607
41:46.585 --> 41:48.925
Because I thought she might be like how I used to be.

608
41:49.925 --> 41:51.995
Who is this woman all of a sudden?

609
41:52.655 --> 41:54.425
Is she cooler than me?

610
41:55.565 --> 41:56.895
I don't know about that,

611
41:57.725 --> 42:01.495
but I know she's completely different from you, Hong Du.

612
42:02.705 --> 42:04.365
Completely different from me?

613
42:05.535 --> 42:06.605
She doesn't have any friends.

614
42:11.045 --> 42:13.375
That kind of tells you how she's lived her life.

615
42:14.775 --> 42:17.815
People get hurt by the ones closest to them,

616
42:18.345 --> 42:19.915
but they also get healed by them.

617
42:21.115 --> 42:23.055
It seems like she never even had that chance.

618
42:25.155 --> 42:26.825
So I really want to meet her.

619
42:28.425 --> 42:30.265
I feel like we'd be good friends.

620
42:32.535 --> 42:34.235
And there's a reason I have to.

621
42:34.295 --> 42:38.505
I don't even know who she is, but I'm starting to get jealous.

622
42:43.945 --> 42:46.315
By the way, isn't our rooftop place great?

623
42:46.315 --> 42:47.845
It really is.

624
42:51.315 --> 42:52.355
Really?

625
42:52.915 --> 42:55.685
Please keep taking good care of Mr. Choi.

626
43:04.925 --> 43:06.365
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard)

627
43:11.165 --> 43:14.075
What? You want me to smile again?

628
43:15.405 --> 43:16.405
I know.

629
43:17.875 --> 43:18.975
You should have lived longer.

630
43:20.115 --> 43:21.575
It's become a drama...

631
43:23.915 --> 43:25.315
I intentionally want to forget...

632
43:25.315 --> 43:26.585
because it keeps making me think of you.

633
43:30.855 --> 43:33.955
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

634
43:37.665 --> 43:39.595
I will pay you whatever salary you want.

635
43:39.665 --> 43:41.795
You start the day you leave the hospital.

636
43:42.365 --> 43:44.765
I'm all better. I'll start right away.

637
43:45.875 --> 43:47.175
Is she a doctor or something?

638
43:47.235 --> 43:49.075
Taking off her bandages however she wants.

639
43:49.705 --> 43:51.575
Creepy. How do I know this?

640
43:51.575 --> 43:52.775
Are you still going to ignore me?

641
43:53.415 --> 43:54.915
It's exactly like the drama.

642
43:56.745 --> 43:58.315
Then was all of that...

643
43:59.955 --> 44:01.915
just lines from the drama?

644
44:02.655 --> 44:03.655
She really...

645
44:05.355 --> 44:08.995
acted like it happened to her.

646
44:12.665 --> 44:14.065
You didn't have to walk me home.

647
44:14.565 --> 44:16.065
We're here. This is my place.

648
44:16.205 --> 44:18.565
Wow, you live in a really nice place.

649
44:19.175 --> 44:20.475
Man, I want to live somewhere like this.

650
44:23.045 --> 44:24.045
Oh?

651
44:28.315 --> 44:29.815
- Hello? - What are you doing tomorrow?

652
44:30.315 --> 44:32.315
I'll head in first. Take your time.

653
44:35.015 --> 44:37.485
- Is someone with you? - Why did you call?

654
44:37.555 --> 44:38.555
Come out tomorrow.

655
44:38.625 --> 44:40.695
Why? You don't have a shoot tomorrow.

656
44:40.755 --> 44:41.825
There's something I need to check.

657
44:46.295 --> 44:47.735
("The Crown Prince's Bodyguard")

658
44:56.975 --> 44:59.275
You're just going to blatantly use me as your stylist, aren't you?

659
44:59.745 --> 45:01.115
Are you going to pay me double then?

660
45:01.175 --> 45:02.545
Carry these and follow me.

661
45:02.615 --> 45:04.085
Did you not call me to check something?

662
45:04.145 --> 45:06.785
What are you checking? What? How strong I'm?

663
45:10.655 --> 45:13.055
Bodyguard rule number one.

664
45:15.225 --> 45:17.395
No matter what, you must not look like a bodyguard.

665
45:18.395 --> 45:19.695
Is that why you're making me carry your bags?

666
45:19.765 --> 45:20.765
Then you're wrong.

667
45:22.935 --> 45:25.035
Because I have the kind of face that looks cool no matter what I do.

668
45:29.775 --> 45:31.445
That sounds really familiar.

669
45:31.505 --> 45:32.845
Is that why you're making me carry your bags?

670
45:33.645 --> 45:34.845
How many times do I have to tell you?

671
45:34.915 --> 45:38.445
I have the kind of face that looks cool no matter what I do.

672
45:39.085 --> 45:41.515
She said that exactly like the drama too.

673
45:50.265 --> 45:51.695
What do you need to check?

674
45:51.765 --> 45:53.495
What? How popular you are?

675
45:53.495 --> 45:55.465
Bodyguard rule number two.

676
45:57.465 --> 46:00.835
The more you stand out to people, the less suspicious you become.

677
46:01.505 --> 46:04.705
Then wouldn't a more common dish be better?

678
46:05.105 --> 46:07.115
Like beef, for example?

679
46:09.245 --> 46:11.215
Gosh, you forgot again.

680
46:11.945 --> 46:15.455
I told you, you need a more common menu for times like this.

681
46:15.525 --> 46:17.185
Like beef, for example?

682
46:21.455 --> 46:22.925
She could just be copying it.

683
46:23.965 --> 46:26.295
If she just memorized the lines by heart...

684
46:36.075 --> 46:37.075
Are you okay?

685
46:37.445 --> 46:39.175
Hey, can't you see someone standing here?

686
46:39.445 --> 46:41.975
- I'm sorry. - Where are your eyes?

687
46:41.975 --> 46:43.585
- She protected me again. - That was almost a disaster.

688
46:44.115 --> 46:45.885
This is not something you can just copy.

689
46:46.215 --> 46:48.455
It only happens if you truly believe it.

690
46:48.515 --> 46:49.525
Hong Du.

691
46:51.725 --> 46:53.455
Tae Bong is here, too.

692
46:54.095 --> 46:55.325
How did you two...

693
47:01.535 --> 47:03.665
The terrible employer Hong Du mentioned...

694
47:03.665 --> 47:05.265
was this close all along.

695
47:08.605 --> 47:11.545
Actually, I went to the sandwich shop earlier...

696
47:11.605 --> 47:15.075
just in case, since it is your favorite place.

697
47:15.515 --> 47:17.145
I thought if I ran into you,

698
47:18.285 --> 47:19.715
it might mean we are destined.

699
47:21.515 --> 47:22.525
What?

700
47:24.955 --> 47:27.655
I'm joking, don't be so scared.

701
47:28.155 --> 47:30.925
It must be nice having such a huge fan by your side.

702
47:31.395 --> 47:33.665
I had a really funny thought earlier.

703
47:34.335 --> 47:36.665
Even if we ignore the name Cha Hong Du,

704
47:36.735 --> 47:39.105
the story about her late father and stepmother...

705
47:39.175 --> 47:41.505
is exactly the same as the drama's plot.

706
47:41.775 --> 47:45.145
But it turns out she did all that just to catch your attention.

707
47:45.405 --> 47:46.975
Playing the tragic heroine.

708
47:47.445 --> 47:50.785
But that didn't sit right with me.

709
47:55.825 --> 47:59.055
He calls me out here and just acts all serious by himself all day.

710
47:59.425 --> 48:01.825
He leaves without even telling me what he confirmed.

711
48:02.195 --> 48:05.465
Anyway, Um Tae Bong was really weird today.

712
48:07.665 --> 48:08.765
By the way,

713
48:09.435 --> 48:11.605
he seems really close with that pretty girl.

714
48:18.205 --> 48:20.775
Darn it, you stupid idiot.

715
48:20.845 --> 48:22.945
Even Hyun Joo found it weird, and only I didn't know.

716
48:23.545 --> 48:25.855
The story about her late father and stepmother...

717
48:25.915 --> 48:28.215
is exactly the same as the drama's plot.

718
48:28.755 --> 48:29.985
There is no way...

719
48:30.655 --> 48:33.295
she would've made up a story about her father.

720
48:33.355 --> 48:35.695
Han Jung Woo, no, Um Tae Bong.

721
48:35.695 --> 48:39.765
Please, find my father.

722
48:40.195 --> 48:43.835
Oh, she definitely called me Han Jung Woo back then.

723
48:43.905 --> 48:45.635
I'm a bodyguard.

724
48:46.375 --> 48:48.805
Your secret bodyguard,

725
48:48.875 --> 48:51.705
Cha Hong Du.

726
48:52.005 --> 48:53.315
Does she really believe...

727
48:54.345 --> 48:56.515
she is a character in a drama?

728
48:57.285 --> 48:58.315
Darn it.

729
49:06.395 --> 49:07.495
Darn it.

730
49:12.395 --> 49:13.465
Is this...

731
49:14.595 --> 49:16.265
seriously the only way?

732
49:28.215 --> 49:29.415
What do you want to talk about?

733
49:32.955 --> 49:34.555
You called me all the way out here,

734
49:34.615 --> 49:36.525
so are we going to have a staring contest this time?

735
49:36.585 --> 49:38.155
If you were just my stalker...

736
49:38.225 --> 49:40.595
and you were the one who sent those letters,

737
49:41.125 --> 49:43.125
I would have tried to reconsider somehow.

738
49:43.195 --> 49:44.765
Because at least that makes sense.

739
49:46.835 --> 49:48.195
Speak so I can understand you.

740
49:48.265 --> 49:50.835
If you approached me to dig up my secrets,

741
49:50.905 --> 49:53.175
and that was why you stuck by my side,

742
49:53.375 --> 49:54.375
I thought about smacking you once...

743
49:54.435 --> 49:56.545
and accepting you as my person. But...

744
49:58.445 --> 49:59.515
If it is not even that...

745
49:59.575 --> 50:01.115
Was there not an incident like that before?

746
50:01.175 --> 50:03.815
Some woman couldn't tell a drama from reality,

747
50:03.885 --> 50:05.285
so she went to find her favorite celebrity...

748
50:05.345 --> 50:07.085
and made a scene, claiming they were married...

749
50:07.085 --> 50:08.115
and that she was having his baby.

750
50:08.185 --> 50:12.155
So there is someone exactly like that right in front of me.

751
50:12.225 --> 50:14.755
People with harsh realities and hard lives do that.

752
50:14.825 --> 50:17.165
They just want to forget reality, even if it means doing that.

753
50:17.225 --> 50:19.335
I feel really bad for people like that.

754
50:19.395 --> 50:20.835
But what a shame.

755
50:20.895 --> 50:22.935
I don't feel bad for you at all.

756
50:23.665 --> 50:25.905
What have you been talking about this whole time?

757
50:30.845 --> 50:31.845
You are fired.

758
50:33.715 --> 50:34.715
What?

759
50:35.945 --> 50:37.215
I'm completely sick of you.

760
50:38.215 --> 50:39.815
- What? - You,

761
50:41.115 --> 50:42.955
get out of my life.

762
50:59.435 --> 51:02.645
He should at least tell me what I did wrong so I know.

763
51:03.245 --> 51:04.445
I'm completely sick of you.

764
51:08.415 --> 51:09.415
Jerk.

765
51:11.145 --> 51:12.185
He didn't have to...

766
51:13.585 --> 51:14.615
say it so harshly.

767
51:20.455 --> 51:23.025
For someone who became so successful,

768
51:23.095 --> 51:24.795
why did the look in your eyes change so much?

769
51:27.465 --> 51:29.065
You have the loneliest eyes in the world.

770
51:30.135 --> 51:32.475
She can't even take care of herself, yet acts like she knows everything.

771
51:41.445 --> 51:43.245
Son, did you eat?

772
51:44.115 --> 51:45.115
Hey, Dad.

773
51:45.115 --> 51:47.155
Yes, I think I'll finish early today.

774
51:47.355 --> 51:48.815
Want to get chicken and beer with your daughter?

775
51:50.355 --> 51:52.625
Cha Hong Du, let's eat.

776
52:01.835 --> 52:03.505
It does not matter if she eats or not anymore.

777
52:04.765 --> 52:06.005
I told you, right?

778
52:06.205 --> 52:07.375
That I would always...

779
52:08.675 --> 52:09.845
protect you.

780
52:19.955 --> 52:23.025
If you're not Cha Hong Du, what is your real name?

781
52:24.325 --> 52:25.325
Darn it.

782
52:38.965 --> 52:40.605
Get your hands off her right now.

783
52:40.675 --> 52:42.005
- Whoa, you scared me. - Oh, you scared me.

784
52:42.075 --> 52:43.105
(Neighborhood Fried Chicken)

785
52:43.645 --> 52:44.905
The person you saw earlier...

786
52:44.905 --> 52:46.975
What was he wearing? Tell me in detail.

787
52:49.245 --> 52:50.945
Cha Hong Du, let's eat.

788
52:55.815 --> 52:57.185
It's gone again.

789
52:59.825 --> 53:00.925
My job...

790
53:04.295 --> 53:05.865
The person who makes me laugh...

791
53:08.665 --> 53:11.165
The person who asks me to eat with him...

792
53:18.905 --> 53:19.945
Here...

793
53:21.045 --> 53:22.045
I added a little extra.

794
53:23.485 --> 53:24.485
Take it.

795
53:26.185 --> 53:28.055
That guy is pretty fickle.

796
53:28.715 --> 53:30.255
Please try to understand, Hong Du.

797
53:30.685 --> 53:31.685
Okay.

798
53:32.225 --> 53:34.155
But you will need to find a new bodyguard, right?

799
53:34.595 --> 53:36.925
Oh, why are you worrying about the guy who just fired you?

800
53:36.995 --> 53:38.495
It's fine. He will figure it out himself.

801
53:40.295 --> 53:41.295
Right.

802
53:43.365 --> 53:44.605
Here.

803
53:45.135 --> 53:46.635
Um Tae Bong gave this to me.

804
53:46.975 --> 53:48.575
Since I'm not his bodyguard anymore.

805
53:49.105 --> 53:50.245
But...

806
53:50.645 --> 53:53.145
Please tell him I can't return the motion sickness medicine.

807
53:54.845 --> 53:56.185
Motion sickness medicine?

808
53:56.245 --> 53:58.685
I can't ride in a car without it now.

809
53:58.745 --> 54:00.315
Tae Bong gave you that too?

810
54:00.385 --> 54:01.685
He gave you all sorts of things.

811
54:01.985 --> 54:03.755
He is not the type to just give his things away to others.

812
54:04.955 --> 54:07.255
Well, goodbye then.

813
54:07.895 --> 54:09.195
Thank you for everything.

814
54:20.235 --> 54:21.635
Do you feel relieved?

815
54:24.145 --> 54:25.675
I will go buy something cold to drink.

816
54:43.325 --> 54:45.795
Do you remember my voice?

817
54:48.365 --> 54:49.405
The blank check?

818
55:00.875 --> 55:01.975
(CEO's Office)

819
55:03.385 --> 55:04.385
Why are you empty-handed?

820
55:05.415 --> 55:07.785
Would it have been better to call the police?

821
55:08.285 --> 55:10.085
She could have been a crazy stalker.

822
55:10.585 --> 55:11.585
Hey.

823
55:13.955 --> 55:15.895
We need to bring Cha Hong Du back.

824
55:16.265 --> 55:17.725
Bring her back?

825
55:17.965 --> 55:21.235
- I barely got rid of her. - No. You have to keep her close.

826
55:21.495 --> 55:23.405
- What are you talking about? - She knows.

827
55:24.165 --> 55:25.665
She knows your secret.

828
55:26.675 --> 55:27.675
(Blank Check)

829
55:30.075 --> 55:31.405
A blank check?

830
55:31.945 --> 55:33.415
Just let her believe what she wants...

831
55:33.945 --> 55:36.985
and keep her by Um Tae Bong's side.

832
55:40.785 --> 55:44.885
Is she the sick person you mentioned last time...

833
55:44.955 --> 55:46.725
The one with a lot of money...

834
55:48.295 --> 55:51.265
I see. I will get hurt if I know too much.

835
55:51.265 --> 55:52.265
But how do I do that?

836
55:52.265 --> 55:55.295
Tae Bong is pretty quick to catch on.

837
55:55.365 --> 55:57.665
I trust you will figure that out.

838
55:57.665 --> 55:59.735
No one can know about our deal.

839
56:00.435 --> 56:01.675
Not even Um Tae Bong.

840
56:04.505 --> 56:06.315
No, she can't know.

841
56:07.645 --> 56:08.915
There is no way she knows.

842
56:08.975 --> 56:10.245
She threatened me.

843
56:17.255 --> 56:18.355
So...

844
56:18.425 --> 56:20.655
- For now, just do as she says... - No.

845
56:21.155 --> 56:22.495
She was weird from the start.

846
56:22.495 --> 56:23.665
She showed up out of nowhere one day...

847
56:23.725 --> 56:26.025
and started acting like the main character in my drama for no reason.

848
56:26.765 --> 56:28.335
What kind of massive shock did she go through?

849
56:29.735 --> 56:32.605
Cha Hong Du, what in the world happened to you?

850
56:33.405 --> 56:35.005
She must have her reasons.

851
56:35.405 --> 56:37.145
She might have been really lonely.

852
56:37.145 --> 56:38.705
I told you before.

853
56:38.775 --> 56:41.415
When you are lonely, it hurts right here.

854
56:41.945 --> 56:43.715
Or is it here? It could hurt here too.

855
56:43.785 --> 56:45.115
If she is hurting,

856
56:45.185 --> 56:47.615
is she more likely to cause trouble?

857
56:47.685 --> 56:50.685
Of course. So for the time being...

858
56:51.155 --> 56:53.455
let's just play along with whatever she wants to believe.

859
56:53.525 --> 56:54.755
This is driving me crazy.

860
56:54.755 --> 56:57.365
Why does she have to know?

861
57:03.565 --> 57:04.565
But...

862
57:08.205 --> 57:10.645
Are you sure that she...

863
57:11.175 --> 57:12.475
threatened you?

864
57:17.485 --> 57:18.485
Hey,

865
57:19.955 --> 57:20.955
do you not trust me?

866
57:23.885 --> 57:24.885
Do I...

867
57:26.425 --> 57:28.155
look like someone who would lie to you?

868
57:36.705 --> 57:37.705
Darn it, seriously.

869
57:46.045 --> 57:47.375
This is driving me crazy.

870
57:47.875 --> 57:48.945
Right.

871
57:50.045 --> 57:51.215
Let's sweep it all away.

872
57:51.615 --> 57:55.315
Sweep the streets, and sweep my heart.

873
57:56.455 --> 58:00.055
I will sweep away all the arrogant jerks in the world too.

874
58:00.155 --> 58:01.525
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

875
58:04.965 --> 58:06.195
Darn it.

876
58:12.405 --> 58:13.875
Why won't this come off?

877
58:26.085 --> 58:27.285
Darn it.

878
58:28.555 --> 58:29.855
Are you doing a horror movie now? Are you playing a zombie?

879
58:29.925 --> 58:31.125
Make it quick, my noodles are boiling.

880
58:31.125 --> 58:35.055
You jerk. Are you more worried about soggy noodles than my life?

881
58:35.125 --> 58:36.125
Is it a girl problem?

882
58:36.195 --> 58:37.795
Do I look like someone who would cause that kind of problem...

883
58:41.035 --> 58:42.695
Sometimes...

884
58:42.765 --> 58:45.605
- I'm that kind of person. - I don't know what it is,

885
58:46.065 --> 58:47.975
but as long as you did nothing to take responsibility for, it is fine.

886
58:48.035 --> 58:51.075
The problem is something happened I have to take responsibility for.

887
58:53.645 --> 58:55.275
Did you get someone pregnant?

888
58:55.345 --> 58:57.515
- Do you want to die? - Do you want to get hit?

889
58:58.215 --> 58:59.215
Anyway.

890
59:00.555 --> 59:02.555
Hey, let's say...

891
59:02.615 --> 59:05.255
you know some fatal information about me.

892
59:05.325 --> 59:06.325
Is it worth money?

893
59:07.825 --> 59:08.825
Get out.

894
59:08.895 --> 59:10.665
What is the number for Distouch? You know a reporter, right?

895
59:10.725 --> 59:12.625
- Get out. Get out. - One with a big mouth.

896
59:12.695 --> 59:13.895
Just go boil your noodles.

897
59:14.965 --> 59:17.835
They say there is a law of total madness for humans.

898
59:17.905 --> 59:20.775
Of course, your total madness is probably higher than normal people.

899
59:21.035 --> 59:22.235
But don't take that madness...

900
59:23.905 --> 59:25.075
out on Hyun Joo.

901
59:28.515 --> 59:29.685
Hey, what does that mean?

902
59:31.015 --> 59:32.185
Tell me before you go.

903
59:32.615 --> 59:33.615
Darn it.

904
59:43.865 --> 59:45.325
You have to solve it.

905
59:45.965 --> 59:47.865
So, Cha Hong Du.

906
59:47.935 --> 59:50.835
No, the one who believes she is Cha Hong Du...

907
59:50.905 --> 59:54.035
I just have to pretend it is real according to her delusion?

908
59:54.805 --> 59:55.805
Darn it.

909
59:57.345 --> 59:59.105
What, is this the "Truman Show" now?

910
59:59.175 --> 01:00:00.715
Am I supposed to shoot a drama just for her?

911
01:00:04.545 --> 01:00:07.955
I thought that crazy stalker was quiet lately,

912
01:00:08.255 --> 01:00:10.555
now there is someone blackmailing me with my secret.

913
01:00:11.725 --> 01:00:13.425
Does she think I will call her back because of that?

914
01:00:15.055 --> 01:00:17.225
Do you know what the scariest thing in the world is?

915
01:00:17.295 --> 01:00:19.895
What, an edgy teenager? No.

916
01:00:20.095 --> 01:00:21.335
People who are weird up here.

917
01:00:21.395 --> 01:00:23.165
Why? Because they are unpredictable.

918
01:00:32.005 --> 01:00:34.315
There was a reason her face was so bright.

919
01:00:34.575 --> 01:00:36.715
It was because she has an unpredictable brain.

920
01:00:38.045 --> 01:00:40.615
I'm still not going to do it. I will never call her.

921
01:00:41.785 --> 01:00:42.855
(Jubong Sweet and Spicy Fried Chicken)

922
01:00:43.185 --> 01:00:44.825
Chicken...

923
01:00:44.885 --> 01:00:46.255
This is the right place...

924
01:00:47.825 --> 01:00:49.825
Darn it. Gosh.

925
01:00:56.365 --> 01:00:57.435
Why are you here?

926
01:00:58.205 --> 01:01:00.675
Don't tell me you want the motion sickness medicine back?

927
01:01:02.375 --> 01:01:04.545
This is so petty.

928
01:01:05.705 --> 01:01:07.515
Come back to work starting tomorrow.

929
01:01:08.115 --> 01:01:09.145
I think I...

930
01:01:10.085 --> 01:01:11.715
made a mistake.

931
01:01:13.655 --> 01:01:14.985
I thought you lost all affection for me.

932
01:01:16.315 --> 01:01:17.325
Me?

933
01:01:18.325 --> 01:01:20.255
If I really did,

934
01:01:20.525 --> 01:01:23.625
give me a chance to apologize.

935
01:01:26.795 --> 01:01:29.135
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

936
01:01:29.695 --> 01:01:31.235
Are you asking me that?

937
01:01:34.675 --> 01:01:37.875
She wanted you, Tae Bong, to never know she blackmailed you.

938
01:01:40.045 --> 01:01:41.145
Just because.

939
01:01:41.215 --> 01:01:43.545
There is a good phrase in the world called "just because."

940
01:01:43.815 --> 01:01:45.985
Just live, just work, just like it.

941
01:01:52.625 --> 01:01:53.825
The last one...

942
01:01:56.125 --> 01:01:57.265
was not a good example.

943
01:01:59.565 --> 01:02:01.295
Did anyone say anything?

944
01:02:04.935 --> 01:02:06.035
You...

945
01:02:06.805 --> 01:02:09.335
When you said you did not know my secret,

946
01:02:10.505 --> 01:02:11.505
was that true?

947
01:02:12.705 --> 01:02:14.015
- Why? - Answer me.

948
01:02:15.115 --> 01:02:16.115
I don't know.

949
01:02:20.485 --> 01:02:21.485
Darn it.

950
01:02:22.685 --> 01:02:24.755
Anyway, I said it.

951
01:02:24.825 --> 01:02:26.155
Keep working.

952
01:02:29.795 --> 01:02:31.495
What? Do you not want to?

953
01:02:32.625 --> 01:02:35.365
Who said I didn't want to? I want to, absolutely.

954
01:02:36.835 --> 01:02:39.165
I really want to.

955
01:03:04.025 --> 01:03:07.095
Right, I hired her back. I did.

956
01:03:07.495 --> 01:03:09.535
So what am I supposed to do now?

957
01:03:10.165 --> 01:03:12.465
Is it enough to just let her stay by my side?

958
01:03:18.845 --> 01:03:20.645
Should I give this back first?

959
01:03:21.745 --> 01:03:22.975
Darn it.

960
01:03:25.245 --> 01:03:26.485
So fickle.

961
01:03:26.985 --> 01:03:29.615
Well, I will let it slide just this one time.

962
01:03:30.685 --> 01:03:31.685
Just because.

963
01:03:31.755 --> 01:03:34.055
There is a good phrase in the world called "just because."

964
01:03:34.125 --> 01:03:36.395
Just live, just work, just like it.

965
01:03:47.505 --> 01:03:48.875
Why is my heart beating so fast?

966
01:03:50.145 --> 01:03:51.575
Is it beating just because, too?

967
01:04:04.155 --> 01:04:05.725
(Name: Choi Gu)

968
01:04:05.885 --> 01:04:08.625
- Where did the patient here go? - He was here just a moment ago.

969
01:04:08.695 --> 01:04:10.865
- Where did he go? - What do you mean?

970
01:04:10.925 --> 01:04:12.065
You don't know where the patient is?

971
01:04:49.965 --> 01:04:51.235
I really found him.

972
01:04:55.135 --> 01:04:56.135
My father.

973
01:05:05.945 --> 01:05:07.385
Cha Hong Du.

974
01:05:07.455 --> 01:05:10.985
No, it doesn't matter what your real name is.

975
01:05:12.425 --> 01:05:13.695
But this is it.

976
01:05:15.995 --> 01:05:17.795
The fake world you believe in...

977
01:05:19.095 --> 01:05:22.095
is the world I have to create for you.

978
01:05:31.705 --> 01:05:34.515
(Oh! My Guard)
